advance_s_2023.description:
These controllers have no printed key. Setup guide: https://github.com/tryoverflow/ventaxia_ha/blob/main/docs/newer_model_setup.md

Note: {ble_status}

The identity is a fixed value used by the Vent-Axia Connect app (leave as 'zirconia'). The PSK is the key your unit exposes over Bluetooth in pairing mode (the 'tlsKey' characteristic); enter it as hex. The Device SSID is the unit's device ID. The data port is 8883.
